  "body": "Meticulously renovated to blend 1960s solid block and concrete construction with modern luxury, this spacious 162m² townhouse offers low-maintenance coastal living at its finest. Situated on the flat in ever-popular Speight Road, you’re just a short, level stroll from the beach.\r\n\r\nDesigned for total versatility, the floor plan adapts effortlessly to your lifestyle. The upper level incorporates a brand-new kitchen, seamlessly integrated with open-plan living and dining; two bedrooms; and a full bathroom (with bathtub). The lower level: bedroom; a generous space that could function as a living area or fourth bedroom; another full bathroom; and a kitchenette that opens out to a lovely secluded patio area. A carport and one off street park cater for parking convenience.\r\n\r\nThe location is impeccable - both Kohi beach and Madills Farm are less than a 5-minute level walk away; a few minutes in the car will take you to Mission Bay on one side, St Heliers on the other; and it’s in zone for Kohimarama School, Selwyn College and St Ignatius. \r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a low-maintenance lock-and-leave, a flexible family home, a stylish option to downsize, or a high-performing investment, this property offers incredible scope. Come explore the possibilities  - call me!\r\n\r\nPlease visit www.barfoot.co.nz/942667 and scroll down to download or view: Title; LIM (where available); Particulars and Conditions of Sale by Auction (where applicable); and other informative documents",
